# 项目接口自测（PyCharm HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 均可）
# 启动：uvicorn app.main:app --reload
# 接口文档：http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/docs

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 文档列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/doc
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 1
X-Space-Id: 1

### 检索调试
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 1
X-Space-Id: 1

{"query": "报销标准是多少", "topk": 5}

### 流式问答（SSE）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 1
X-Space-Id: 1

{"question": "报销标准是多少"}
